  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the spaghetti according to package instructions.",
    "In a kadhai, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the cherry tomatoes and cook until they start to release their juices.",
    "Add the coconut flakes and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pasta water and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked spaghetti to the kadhai and toss to combine with the sauce.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped basil and grated parmesan cheese.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
